-What?

512
00:36:00,700 --> 00:36:02,076
Us finding Sam?

513
00:36:02,744 --> 00:36:05,913
lt's gotta be about getting him back,
not pushing him away.

514
00:36:07,332 --> 00:36:08,833
Right.

515
00:36:09,000 --> 00:36:12,711
l know you're mad, Dean . l understand .
You got a right to be. . .

516
00:36:12,879 --> 00:36:14,213
. . .but l'm just saying.

517
00:36:14,673 --> 00:36:16,382
Be good to him anyway.

518
00:36:16,550 --> 00:36:18,926
You gotta get through to him.

519
00:36:21,930 --> 00:36:23,597
[DOOR OPENS]

520
00:36:41,241 --> 00:36:42,283
[FLOOR CREAKS]

521
00:36:42,784 --> 00:36:43,909
[BOTH GRUNTlNG]

522
00:36:58,633 --> 00:37:00,134
No.

523
00:37:00,302 --> 00:37:01,385
Let her go.

524
00:37:01,970 --> 00:37:04,054
Just take it easy.

525
00:37:04,806 --> 00:37:07,600
Well, it must've been some party
you two had going. . .

526
00:37:07,767 --> 00:37:11,312
. . .considering how hard you tried
to keep me from crashing it.

527
00:37:11,938 --> 00:37:13,981
Well, solid try. . .

528
00:37:14,149 --> 00:37:15,816
. . .but here l am.

529
00:37:15,984 --> 00:37:17,318
Dean, l'm glad you're here.

530
00:37:18,153 --> 00:37:20,654
Look. Let's just talk about this.

531
00:37:20,822 --> 00:37:23,449
Soon as she's dead ,
we can talk all you want.

532
00:37:27,162 --> 00:37:30,080
-Ruby, get out of here.
-No, she's not going anywhere.

533
00:37:34,252 --> 00:37:36,253
-She's poison.
-lt's not what you think.

534
00:37:36,421 --> 00:37:38,505
Look what she did to you .

535
00:37:39,257 --> 00:37:41,926
She vanishes weeks at a time,
leaves you cracking out. . .

536
00:37:42,093 --> 00:37:45,346
-. . .for another hit--
-She was looking for Lilith.

537
00:37:45,847 --> 00:37:48,474
French for manipulating your ass
1 0 ways from Sunday.

538
00:37:48,642 --> 00:37:50,142
You're wrong, Dean.

539
00:37:51,686 --> 00:37:54,438
Sam, you're lying to yourself.

540
00:37:55,482 --> 00:37:58,609
l just want you to be okay.

541
00:38:00,195 --> 00:38:03,197
You would do the same for me.
You know you would .

542
00:38:03,448 --> 00:38:05,199
Just listen.

543
00:38:08,495 --> 00:38:11,288
Just listen for a second .

544
00:38:11,665 --> 00:38:13,791
We got a lead on a demon
close to Lilith .

545
00:38:13,959 --> 00:38:15,709
Come with us, Dean.

546
00:38:15,877 --> 00:38:17,211
We'll do this together.

547
00:38:18,088 --> 00:38:19,213
That sounds great.

548
00:38:20,215 --> 00:38:23,008
As long as it's you and me.
Demon bitch is a deal-breaker.

549
00:38:23,176 --> 00:38:25,719
You kiss her goodbye,
we can go right now.

550
00:38:27,180 --> 00:38:28,472
l can't.

551
00:38:28,640 --> 00:38:31,809
Dean, l need her to help me kill Lilith .

552
00:38:31,977 --> 00:38:35,354
l know you can't wrap your head
around it but maybe one day. . .

553
00:38:35,522 --> 00:38:37,606
. . .you'll understand .

554
00:38:38,191 --> 00:38:39,316
[SlGHS]

555
00:38:39,484 --> 00:38:41,193
l'm the only one
who can do this, Dean.

556
00:38:46,741 --> 00:38:48,909
No, you're not the one
who's gonna do this.

557
00:38:49,077 --> 00:38:51,745
Right. That's right. l forgot.
The angels think it's you.

558
00:38:51,913 --> 00:38:53,539
-You don't think l can?
-No.

559
00:38:54,040 --> 00:38:55,749
You can't.

560
00:38:55,917 --> 00:38:57,876
-You're not strong enough.
-Who are you?

561
00:38:58,044 --> 00:38:59,420
l'm being practical here.

562
00:38:59,629 --> 00:39:02,923
-l'm doing what needs to be done.
-Yeah?

563
00:39:03,133 --> 00:39:05,009
You're not gonna do a single
damn thing.

564
00:39:05,176 --> 00:39:07,636
Stop bossing me around, Dean.

565
00:39:08,263 --> 00:39:09,763
Look.

566
00:39:10,181 --> 00:39:11,682
My whole life. . .

567
00:39:11,850 --> 00:39:14,435
. . .you take the wheel,
you call the shots. . .

568
00:39:14,644 --> 00:39:17,229
. . .and l trust you
because you are my brother.

569
00:39:18,273 --> 00:39:19,606
Now. . .

570
00:39:19,774 --> 00:39:23,277
. . . l'm asking you, for once. . .

571
00:39:23,445 --> 00:39:25,237
. . .trust me.

572
00:39:31,369 --> 00:39:33,746
No. You don't know
what you're doing, Sam.

573
00:39:33,913 --> 00:39:35,372
-Yes, l do.
-Then that's worse.

574
00:39:35,790 --> 00:39:37,583
Why? Look, l'm telling you--

575
00:39:37,751 --> 00:39:40,794
Because it's not something you're doing,
it's what you are!

576
00:39:42,964 --> 00:39:44,798
lt means--

577
00:39:45,884 --> 00:39:47,301
What?

578
00:39:50,972 --> 00:39:52,181
No.

579
00:39:57,645 --> 00:39:59,146
Say it.

580
00:40:01,816 --> 00:40:03,067
lt means you're a monster.

581
00:40:08,448 --> 00:40:10,491
[GRUNTS]

582
00:40:12,327 --> 00:40:14,119
[GASPl NG]

583
00:40:30,220 --> 00:40:32,763
[BOTH GRUNTlNG]

584
00:40:53,368 --> 00:40:54,535
[GROANS]

585
00:40:54,744 --> 00:40:55,786
[COUGHS]

586
00:41:19,894 --> 00:41:21,395
[COUGH l NG]

587
00:41:21,896 --> 00:41:24,273
You don't know me.

588
00:41:24,941 --> 00:41:26,358
You never did .

589
00:41:28,069 --> 00:41:29,695
And you never will.

590
00:41:29,863 --> 00:41:31,405
[GASPS]

591
00:41:33,783 --> 00:41:35,868
You walk out that door. . .

592
00:41:36,035 --> 00:41:38,537
. . .don't you ever come back.

593
00:41:50,925 --> 00:41:52,176
[DOOR CLOSES]

594
00:41:56,556 --> 00:41:58,265
[GROANS]

595
00:42:35,845 --> 00:42:37,846
[ENGLlSH SDH]

